{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45649","headline":"寄王涤 · 贯休","name":"寄王涤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梅月多开户，衣裳润欲滴。\n寂寥虽无形，不是小讐敌。\n地虚草木壮，雨白桃李赤。\n永日无人来，庭花苦狼籍。\n吟高好鸟觑，风静茶烟直。\n唯思莱子来，衣拖五般色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}